\b Installation and updates\b0\par
This installer places the launcher and shortcuts on your computer. Choose the installation folder on the next screen. Downloaded clients, scenery packs and future launcher updates stay in that folder. Your saved projects and recovery files are stored separately.\par\par
When opened, the launcher checks GitHub for signed updates. It displays the available release and download size and asks you to install or update. It does not download or apply packages until you choose to proceed. The first installation needs internet. The installed editor remains available offline. GitHub and Microsoft process ordinary download and certificate-validation requests. No telemetry is added.\par\par
